e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −3 to +5 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1976","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-san-diego-chargers","name":"San Diego Chargers","code":"SDC","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 27)","str":83.7,"squad":[["Dan Fouts","QB",87],["James Harris","QB",55],["Clarence Williams","RB",92],["Mike Thomas","RB",80],["John Jefferson","WR",95],["Charlie Joiner","WR",87],["John Floyd","WR",68],["Larry Burton","WR",62],["Bob Klein","TE",80],["Kellen Winslow","TE",65],["Billy Shields","OL",98],["Ed White","OL",98],["Russ Washington","OL",98],["Doug Wilkerson","OL",68],["Bob Rush","OL",67],["Don Macek","OL",64],["Dan Audick","OL",62],["Wilbur Young","DL",99],["Leroy Jones","DL",87],["Fred Dean","DL",86],["Gary Johnson","DL",83],["Charles DeJurnett","DL",67],["John Lee","DL",62],["Woodrow Lowe","LB",88],["Ray Preston","LB",86],["Bob Horn","LB",80],["Mike Williams","CB",84],["Willie Buchanon","CB",73],["Jerome Dove","CB",65],["Mike Fuller","S",80],["Glen Edwards","S",78],["Pete Shaw","S",62],["Mike Wood","K",79]]},{"id":"nfl-pittsburgh-steelers","name":"Pittsburgh Steelers","code":"PIT","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 142)","str":83.4,"squad":[["Terry Bradshaw","QB",88],["Mike Kruczek","QB",58],["Franco Harris","RB",96],["Sidney Thornton","RB",86],["John Stallworth","WR",96],["Lynn Swann","WR",83],["Jim Smith","WR",75],["Theo Bell","WR",68],["Bennie Cunningham","TE",74],["Randy Grossman","TE",74],["Mike Webster"